&lt;p&gt;The committee&rsquo;s agenda includes:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Review annual board governance performance evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Review updated new board member orientation packet&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Work on agenda development document&lt;/li&gt;
