&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Accommodations for people with disabilities, and special materials, services, or assistance can be arranged at least 24 hours in advance of the meeting at 503-302-6344 or by email at &lt;a href="mailto:boardofforestry@odf.oregon.gov"&gt;boardofforestry@odf.oregon.gov&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

