&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Jennifer Burrows, chief executive of Providence Oregon, will continue to serve as Chair through 2027. Cheryl Nester Wolfe, president and CEO of Salem Health, will continue to serve as Past-Chair.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

